      "source": "/Users/jennyma/Projects/InfraAgent/data/datasets/infra-repos-v1/corpus/AIInfraGuide/docs/guides/模块二-CUDA编程与算子优化/4.1-CUDA GEMM算子性能优化.md",
      "sha256": "8c6183229c3df5712c159dceb8d3071f11d0b1184c1fec468f3eddf2f595b7a2",
      "locator": "/Users/jennyma/Projects/InfraAgent/data/datasets/infra-repos-v1/corpus/AIInfraGuide/docs/guides/模块二-CUDA编程与算子优化/4.1-CUDA GEMM算子性能优化.md#L525-L535",
      "content": "```cuda\n// 从 Global Memory 加载 A 的一行（连续），转置存入 Shared Memory\nfloat4 a_val = FLOAT4(A[global_row * K + bk + load_col]);\nAs[load_col + 0][local_row] = a_val.x;\nAs[load_col + 1][local_row] = a_val.y;\nAs[load_col + 2][local_row] = a_val.z;\nAs[load_col + 3][local_row] = a_val.w;\n\n// 从 Shared Memory 读取时可以用 float4（连续地址）\nfloat4 a_frag_vec = FLOAT4(As[k][thread_row]);\n```",
      "truncated": false,
